#, no-wrap
msgid "Since the goal of this tutorial is to show how QAOA performs at scales beyond what a simulator can handle, we will forgo this step.\n"
msgstr "Poiché l'obiettivo di questo tutorial è mostrare come QAOA si comporta a scale oltre quelle gestibili da un simulatore, salteremo questo passo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you would like to try a simulator-based QAOA workflow, try out the [Quantum approximate optimization algorithm](/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm) tutorial.\n"
msgstr "Se vuoi provare un workflow QAOA basato su simulatore, prova il tutorial [Quantum approximate optimization algorithm](/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm).\n"

